            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lulusa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made it vegan, so I used almond milk and a 12oz package of soft tofu instead of eggs, which also allows to skip the oil. It was delicious",
            "datePublished": "2018-12-05T01:11:03.827Z"
