            "reviewBody": "OMG! I didn't have the coconut, cherries or raisins, so I omitted them, but did have fresh from the orchard walnuts, so they were chopped and added. Rather than grating carrots... I juice, so I used the pulp from my juicing that morning... carrots, celery, granny smith apples. The batter, it was level with the bread pan when it went into the oven, but puffed up oh so nice... you can see the pan level where the sides meet the top. As with any bread I bake, once out of the oven, the top gets covered with butter right out of the frig.",
